<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate up 7 pct on Camp John Hay talk.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate up 7 pct on Camp John Hay talk.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fil-Estate Land shares rose 1.50 pesos, or 7.06 percent, to 22.75 pesos on Monday on talk the signing between Fil-Estate Land and a government agency for the development of Camp John Hay will push through, brokers said.</p>
</text>
